      "result": "{\"cursor\":13154,\"since_player\":\"Llama4 Valley\",\"log\":\"Llama4 Valley turn 1 (19 - 20)\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eLlama4 Valley\\u003c/font\\u003e - Ability triggers: \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#B0C4DE\\u0027 object_id\\u003d\\u00270b67ced9-3295-44b6-bf2d-88d4e04c0d60\\u0027\\u003eMishra\\u0027s Bauble\\u003c/font\\u003e [0b6] - Draw a card at the beginning of the next turn\\u0027s upkeep.\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eLlama4 Valley\\u003c/font\\u003e draws a card\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eSonnet Spike\\u003c/font\\u003e draws a card\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eSonnet Spike\\u003c/font\\u003e skip attack\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eSonnet Spike\\u003c/font\\u003e puts \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#B0C4DE\\u0027 object_id\\u003d\\u00273b2c2139-fbfc-47a0-bf38-d2c9defd4f81\\u0027\\u003eIsland\\u003c/font\\u003e [3b2] from hand onto the Battlefield\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eSonnet Spike\\u003c/font\\u003e plays \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#B0C4DE\\u0027 object_id\\u003d\\u00273b2c2139-fbfc-47a0-bf38-d2c9defd4f81\\u0027\\u003eIsland\\u003c/font\\u003e [3b2]\\nSonnet Spike turn 1 (19 - 20)\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eLlama4 Valley\\u003c/font\\u003e draws a card\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eLlama4 Valley\\u003c/font\\u003e puts \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#B0C4DE\\u0027 object_id\\u003d\\u0027825b0266-f633-4fbd-bc2a-71ff113d2521\\u0027\\u003eBloodstained Mire\\u003c/font\\u003e [825] from hand onto the Battlefield\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eLlama4 Valley\\u003c/font\\u003e plays \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#B0C4DE\\u0027 object_id\\u003d\\u0027825b0266-f633-4fbd-bc2a-71ff113d2521\\u0027\\u003eBloodstained Mire\\u003c/font\\u003e [825]\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eLlama4 Valley\\u003c/font\\u003e activates: search your library for a Swamp or Mountain card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle. from \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#B0C4DE\\u0027 object_id\\u003d\\u0027825b0266-f633-4fbd-bc2a-71ff113d2521\\u0027\\u003eBloodstained Mire\\u003c/font\\u003e [825]\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eLlama4 Valley\\u003c/font\\u003e loses 1 life from \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#B0C4DE\\u0027 object_id\\u003d\\u0027825b0266-f633-4fbd-bc2a-71ff113d2521\\u0027\\u003eBloodstained Mire\\u003c/font\\u003e [825]\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eLlama4 Valley\\u003c/font\\u003e sacrificed \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#B0C4DE\\u0027 object_id\\u003d\\u0027825b0266-f633-4fbd-bc2a-71ff113d2521\\u0027\\u003eBloodstained Mire\\u003c/font\\u003e [825] (source: \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#B0C4DE\\u0027 object_id\\u003d\\u0027825b0266-f633-4fbd-bc2a-71ff113d2521\\u0027\\u003eBloodstained Mire\\u003c/font\\u003e [825])\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eLlama4 Valley\\u003c/font\\u003e searches their library (source: \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#B0C4DE\\u0027 object_id\\u003d\\u0027825b0266-f633-4fbd-bc2a-71ff113d2521\\u0027\\u003eBloodstained Mire\\u003c/font\\u003e [825])\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eLlama4 Valley\\u003c/font\\u003e puts \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#B0C4DE\\u0027 object_id\\u003d\\u002725c44266-deb4-4519-ac1f-e40ae14fdab7\\u0027\\u003eMountain\\u003c/font\\u003e [25c] from library onto the Battlefield (source: \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#B0C4DE\\u0027 object_id\\u003d\\u0027825b0266-f633-4fbd-bc2a-71ff113d2521\\u0027\\u003eBloodstained Mire\\u003c/font\\u003e [825])\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eLlama4 Valley\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u0027s library is shuffled (source: \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#B0C4DE\\u0027 object_id\\u003d\\u0027825b0266-f633-4fbd-bc2a-71ff113d2521\\u0027\\u003eBloodstained Mire\\u003c/font\\u00